docs {
  Order, payment, library, download and refund request (EP-30 to EP-34, EP-50, EP-51, EP-60, EP-61), buying the listing the seller folder created.

  Payment is completed through EP-99, which only exists when the API runs in Development with Payments:Provider=Fake. The Worker must be running: it turns the payment webhook into a paid order.
}
